    "text": "<p>(A) For a spontaneous process&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;G</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Isobaric process(pressure is constant in this process)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></math>&nbsp;Isothermal process(Temperature is constant in this process).</p><p>(C) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi>reaction</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#931;</mi></math> Bond energies of reactants)-<br />(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#931;</mi></math>bond energies of products)</p><p>(D) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is for exothermic reaction</p>"
